  "english_translation": "Four farm tools are laid out on a worn cream-coloured surface. These tools include a hoe with a long wooden handle, a slasher, a knife, and a grass cutter. At the market, two women sit beneath an umbrella that is black on top with cream sides. They are wearing different tops—one red and the other green with white trim. Nearby, a pair of closed black women's shoes rests on white and blue tiles.",
